+```
+
+The audit-only `/proc/*/exe` compatibility shim was built and checked with:
+
+```bash
+cc -shared -fPIC -Wall -Wextra -O2 \
+  /audit-output/evidence/lean_proc_exe_shim.c -ldl \
+  -o /audit-output/evidence/lean_proc_exe_shim.so
